WEBVTT

00:02:58.566 --> 00:03:03.165
from having tried this in my 20s --
dreamed it and imagined it.

00:03:04.303 --> 00:03:08.908
The most famous body of water
on the Earth today, I imagine,

00:03:08.932 --> 00:03:10.346
Cuba to Florida.

00:03:10.894 --> 00:03:14.281
And it was deep. It was deep in my soul.

00:03:15.121 --> 00:03:16.715
When I turned 60,

00:03:17.411 --> 00:03:20.040
it wasn't so much
about the athletic accomplishment,

00:03:20.064 --> 00:03:23.355
it wasn't the ego
of "I want to be the first."

00:03:23.379 --> 00:03:25.633
That's always there and it's undeniable.

00:03:26.101 --> 00:03:27.874
But it was deeper.

00:03:27.898 --> 00:03:29.931
It was "how much life is there left?"

00:03:29.955 --> 00:03:32.766
Let's face it -- we're all
on a one-way street, aren't we?